{'symbol': 'FCX', 'date': '2023-03-22 08:30:00', 'title': 'FREEPORT-MCMORAN DECLARES QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDENDS ON COMMON STOCK', 'text': "PHOENIX--(BUSINESS WIRE)--FREEPORT-MCMORAN INC. (NYSE: FCX) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARED CASH DIVIDENDS OF $0.15 PER SHARE ON FCX'S COMMON STOCK PAYABLE ON MAY 1, 2023, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF APRIL 14, 2023. THE DECLARATION INCLUDES A BASE DIVIDEND OF $0.075 PER SHARE AND VARIABLE DIVIDEND OF $0.075 PER SHARE IN ACCORDANCE WITH FCX'S PERFORMANCE-BASED PAYOUT FRAMEWORK."}